`ConvertKzgCommitmentToVersionedHash` in `/home/gohan/runners/security-agent-1/_work/security-agent/security-agent/target_workspace/consensus-types/primitives/kzg.go` enforces the 0x01 version prefix by **unconditional assignment** (`versionedHash[0] = blobCommitmentVersionKZG`), not by a conditional check. No attacker-controlled input can produce a non-0x01 prefix through this path. All three call sites use this same function. The invariant holds by construction. Not bug-bounty eligible.

